.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH share 1  "share " 
.SH NAME
share \- Mint a read\-only share link for a collection (Peak C6, ADR 0011). The full URL is printed once \- only its hash is stored. Anyone with the link can read the collection\*(Aqs current snippets; the link expires and can be revoked with `collection unshare`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshare\fR [\fB\-\-days\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fICOLLECTION\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mint a read\-only share link for a collection (Peak C6, ADR 0011). The full URL is printed once \- only its hash is stored. Anyone with the link can read the collection\*(Aqs current snippets; the link expires and can be revoked with `collection unshare`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-days\fR \fI<DAYS>\fR [default: 7]
Expiry: 1, 7 or 30 days
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fICOLLECTION\fR>
Collection name (yours)
